{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_0A9746B8A9FAE75CA992","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十五条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十五条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十五条","quote":"共同犯罪是指二人以上共同故意犯罪。\n二人以上共同过失犯罪，不以共同犯罪论处；应当负刑事责任的，按照他们所犯的罪分别处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_318EB0450C3ADAAC0192","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第七十二条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第七十二条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第七十二条","quote":"对于被判处拘役、三年以下有期徒刑的犯罪分子，同时符合下列条件的，可以宣告缓刑，对其中不满十八周岁的人、怀孕的妇女和已满七十五周岁的人，应当宣告缓刑：\n（一）犯罪情节较轻；\n（二）有悔罪表现；\n（三）没有再犯罪的危险；\n（四）宣告缓刑对所居住社区没有重大不良影响。\n宣告缓刑，可以根据犯罪情况，同时禁止犯罪分子在缓刑考验期限内从事特定活动，进入特定区域、场所，接触特定的人。\n被宣告缓刑的犯罪分子，如果被判处附加刑，附加刑仍须执行。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_510E655CB2E4E971FF5B","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第一百一十五条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第一百一十五条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第一百一十五条","quote":"放火、决水、爆炸以及投放毒害性、放射性、传染病病原体等物质或者以其他危险方法致人重伤、死亡或者使公私财产遭受重大损失的，处十年以上有期徒刑、无期徒刑或者死刑。\n过失犯前款罪的，处三年以上七年以下有期徒刑；情节较轻的，处三年以下有期徒刑或者拘役。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_739F98E83E2A8E71CE61","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二百六十三条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二百六十三条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二百六十三条","quote":"以暴力、胁迫或者其他方法抢劫公私财物的，处三年以上十年以下有期徒刑，并处罚金；有下列情形之一的，处十年以上有期徒刑、无期徒刑或者死刑，并处罚金或者没收财产：\n（一）入户抢劫的；\n（二）在公共交通工具上抢劫的；\n（三）抢劫银行或者其他金融机构的；\n（四）多次抢劫或者抢劫数额巨大的；\n（五）抢劫致人重伤、死亡的；\n（六）冒充军警人员抢劫的；\n（七）持枪抢劫的；\n（八）抢劫军用物资或者抢险、救灾、救济物资的。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_8E9A87FF363B6FAB8D94","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第十七条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第十七条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第十七条","quote":"已满十六周岁的人犯罪，应当负刑事责任。\n已满十四周岁不满十六周岁的人，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或者死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任。\n已满十二周岁不满十四周岁的人，犯故意杀人、故意伤害罪，致人死亡或者以特别残忍手段致人重伤造成严重残疾，情节恶劣，经最高人民检察院核准追诉的，应当负刑事责任。\n对依照前三款规定追究刑事责任的不满十八周岁的人，应当从轻或者减轻处罚。\n因不满十六周岁不予刑事处罚的，责令其父母或者其他监护人加以管教；在必要的时候，依法进行专门矫治教育。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_9CB6894B3E55465B19C6","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十条","quote":"为了使国家、公共利益、本人或者他人的人身、财产和其他权利免受正在进行的不法侵害，而采取的制止不法侵害的行为，对不法侵害人造成损害的，属于正当防卫，不负刑事责任。\n正当防卫明显超过必要限度造成重大损害的，应当负刑事责任，但是应当减轻或者免除处罚。\n对正在进行行凶、杀人、抢劫、强奸、绑架以及其他严重危及人身安全的暴力犯罪，采取防卫行为，造成不法侵害人伤亡的，不属于防卫过当，不负刑事责任。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_DEA5DEB2B315566F5714","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第四十八条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第四十八条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第四十八条","quote":"死刑只适用于罪行极其严重的犯罪分子。对于应当判处死刑的犯罪分子，如果不是必须立即执行的，可以判处死刑同时宣告缓期二年执行。\n死刑除依法由最高人民法院判决的以外，都应当报请最高人民法院核准。死刑缓期执行的，可以由高级人民法院判决或者核准。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_EEA568A60C32E7D0F861","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第一百三十三条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第一百三十三条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第一百三十三条","quote":"违反交通运输管理法规，因而发生重大事故，致人重伤、死亡或者使公私财产遭受重大损失的，处三年以下有期徒刑或者拘役；交通运输肇事后逃逸或者有其他特别恶劣情节的，处三年以上七年以下有期徒刑；因逃逸致人死亡的，处七年以上有期徒刑。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_F941B6583D182A650275","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第一百一十四条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第一百一十四条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第一百一十四条","quote":"放火、决水、爆炸以及投放毒害性、放射性、传染病病原体等物质或者以其他危险方法危害公共安全，尚未造成严重后果的，处三年以上十年以下有期徒刑。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
